    "b-rulebook-intro-2": {
      "id": "b-rulebook-intro-2",
      "flavour": "paragraph",
      "children": [],
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "These rules come from the eight polished boards in "
        },
        {
          "insert": "canvases/",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " — agent-flows-2, bubba-voice, claude-code-researcher, gc-decomp-harness, ink-diagrams, intent-classification-1 and -2, and v2-flow. Their composition lessons are expressed by the single "
        },
        {
          "insert": "Calm and uniform — uniformity is information",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true,
            "reference": {
              "kind": "source",
              "path": "packages/canvas-agent/src/catalog/layout-editor/context/style-guide/aesthetic.ts",
              "symbol": "style"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " aesthetic topic and by the constraints inside the six workflow phases. The system prompt's four top-level sections are purpose, board_model, state_grammar, and workflow; phase constraints carry the operational rules. Corpus evidence remains cited inline; the runtime surfaces named below own behavior."
        }
      ]
    },
    "b-rulebook-naming-3": {
      "id": "b-rulebook-naming-3",
      "flavour": "paragraph",
      "children": [],
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The capability blocks define the four entity kinds and their operations. The op path applies the mechanical invariants: geometry patches are complete finite rectangles, every number a gesture writes to geometry lands on the agent's 20 grid, section membership is reconciled from geometry, sections keep the geometry they are given until fit_section closes one, and the locked page frame is protected. The "
        },
        {
          "insert": "covered-content",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true,
            "reference": {
              "kind": "source",
              "path": "packages/canvas-agent/src/board/lints/rules/covered-content.ts"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", "
        },
        {
          "insert": "containment",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true,
            "reference": {
              "kind": "source",
              "path": "packages/canvas-agent/src/board/lints/rules/containment.ts"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", "
        },
        {
          "insert": "broken-edges",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true,
            "reference": {
              "kind": "source",
              "path": "packages/canvas-agent/src/board/lints/rules/broken-edges.ts"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", "
        },
        {
          "insert": "crowding",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true,
            "reference": {
              "kind": "source",
              "path": "packages/canvas-agent/src/board/lints/rules/crowding.ts"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", "
        },
        {
          "insert": "unreadable-labels",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true,
            "reference": {
              "kind": "source",
              "path": "packages/canvas-agent/src/board/lints/rules/unreadable-labels.ts"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", and "
        },
        {
          "insert": "clipped-text",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true,
            "reference": {
              "kind": "source",
              "path": "packages/canvas-agent/src/board/lints/rules/clipped-text.ts"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " lints judge production geometry. Error-tier findings block a committed finalize; warning-tier findings must be fixed or named as deliberate overrides. A fixable finding includes ready-to-send "
        },
        {
          "insert": "suggested op:",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " JSON."
        }
      ]
    },
